{"title": "Dungeon Delver: Resist Traps", "pageid": 22727, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dungeon_Delver:_Resist_Traps", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Dungeon_Delver:_Perception\" title=\"Dungeon Delver: Perception\">Dungeon Delver: Perception</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dungeon_Delver_Resist_Traps.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Dungeon_Delver_Resist_Traps.webp/300px-Dungeon_Delver_Resist_Traps.webp, /w/images/e/ea/Dungeon_Delver_Resist_Traps.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Dungeon_Delver_Resist_Traps.webp/300px-Dungeon_Delver_Resist_Traps.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Dungeon_Delver_Resist_Traps.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Dungeon Delver: Resist Traps</b> is a passive feature obtainable by the <a href=\"/wiki/Dungeon_Delver\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dungeon Delver\">Dungeon Delver</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>. It makes the wearer more likely to avoid traps as well as resist the damage from them.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a> made to avoid traps and <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to trap damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Dungeon_Delver\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dungeon Delver\">Dungeon Delver</a>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Prior to <a href=\"/wiki/Patch_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Patch 6\">Patch 6</a>, this feature had no programmed effects.</li>\n<li>This passive works against any action using the <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsTrap_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsTrap (spell flag)\">IsTrap</a></code> spell flag.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195712\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 680/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3665/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2321/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 16/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 696933/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\